WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:03.686
This is UniMart, the mini mart on your campus.

00:05.900 --> 00:10.260
Two apps: a storefront for students, and an admin console for staff.

00:10.760 --> 00:14.375
Both run on one Python process and one SQLite database.

00:16.267 --> 00:19.523
Sixty-six products on four shelves, priced in baht.

00:20.033 --> 00:21.992
Search filters the shelves as you type.

00:23.767 --> 00:26.657
Prices switch between baht and dollars at a fixed rate.

00:27.767 --> 00:30.041
Sold-out items can't be added to the cart.

00:31.300 --> 00:34.471
Add items, and the cart shows the delivery fee and total.

00:38.867 --> 00:42.344
Checkout takes a delivery address and one of three payment methods.

00:46.533 --> 00:50.705
A PromptPay QR code is generated for each order. This one is a demo.

00:51.200 --> 00:56.561
Placing the order gives a reference, FC-2026-0128.

00:57.067 --> 00:59.123
Then the shopper uploads their payment slip.

01:02.433 --> 01:04.650
Staff see stock and sales at a glance.

01:07.433 --> 01:10.061
Click any day on the chart to see that day's orders.

01:13.233 --> 01:15.816
Filter low stock, and restock with a reason.

01:20.400 --> 01:22.456
Every change is logged in stock history.

01:24.400 --> 01:26.840
Packing is blocked until the payment is confirmed.

01:27.900 --> 01:30.155
Staff check the slip and confirm the payment.

01:33.533 --> 01:34.938
The order moves to packing,

01:37.533 --> 01:40.476
and the shopper sees the same status in their order history.

01:43.033 --> 01:45.633
UniMart. Browse, pay, track.
